  "solution": "Given:\n\n (x+(1)/(x))=7 \n\n**Formula used:**\n\nx - 1/x = √[(x+1/x)2 - 4]\n\n (x³-(1)/(x³))= (x - 1/x)3 + 3 (x - 1/x)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n (x+(1)/(x))=7 \n\nx - 1/x = √[(x+1/x)² - 4]\n\n⇒ √45 = 3√5\n\n (x³-(1)/(x³)) = (x - 1/x)³ + 3 (x - 1/x)\n\n⇒ 135√5 + 9√5 = 144√5\n\n**∴ The correct option is 2**",
